        medium: 'Bids aggressively to reach the 30-point game mark. Uses basic finessing in play.',
        hard: "Performs complex probability analysis for overtricks. Uses 'Above the Line' honor tracking to decide between a risky high bid or a safe defensive pass.",
      },
      considerations: [
        'AI must differentiate its bidding weighting from modern bridge (overtricks = game points).',
        'Honor score simulation is required for valuation.',
